The strumming pattern will be different if You are playing the acoustic version. The chords remain the same but the pattern will vary.

Metal Version:DDDD DDUD
Acoutic Version:DDUD DDDD

If You face any problem don't hesitate to leave a comment or else drop an email. 
God Bless You.


